t how powerful it is. 🙂 The full ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:02:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692296","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956920-1846018067936511","game_id":"steam-4956920","kind":"announcement","title":"A New Card Mini-Game Is Coming to Heroes Saga!","summary":"Hey everyone,The next Heroes Saga update will introduce a new way to have fun: a card mini-game! Build your deck, play character cards, and defeat your opponents!The update is coming very soon - this October-November.Buy Heroes Saga on Steam:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T15:23:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936511","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956920-1845383656383629","game_id":"steam-4956920","kind":"announcement","title":"🍂 The Steam Autumn Sale is a great time to pick up games from FEYADA! 🍂","summary":"Knightly Passions — 40% off for the first time! This is the biggest discount we’ve ever offered on the game. If you’ve been waiting for a better deal, now’s your chance.Heroes Saga — 15% off before the price goes up. Version 0.3 is planned for late October to early November, and the game’s price will increase with its release. Buying now means you get a discount on the current price, before the increase.Don’t miss out! The sale ends on October 8 at 5:00 PM UTC (8:00 PM MSK).","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T19:00:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656383629","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956920-1844751498229872","game_id":"steam-4956920","kind":"update","title":"Knightly Passions 2.0 - A Major Update Is on the Way!","summary":"Dear friends,We’re excited to share that we’re working on Knightly Passions again! ❤️While our teams are creating new games, we’re also preparing a major update for Knightly Passions - version 2.0. We want the hunter’s adventure to feel great for those discovering it for the first time and for those who decide to return. What are we improving?We’re playing through the game again, finding and fixing bugs, reviewing the balance, and refining its mechanics. We’re also reading your feedback and payi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T20:06:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498229872","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956920-1844115010499609","game_id":"steam-4956920","kind":"update","title":"Heroes Saga - A New Update Is Coming Soon!","summary":"Hey everyone!In Heroes Saga, first impressions can be deceiving. In the next update, one of the heroines will reveal her true form. You might just see her in a whole new light... Who do you think it is? The girl in the picture is your biggest clue. Share your guesses in the comments! Now, a little news about the update itself. We’re planning to release the next version of Heroes Saga in October-November 2026. With this update, the game’s price will increase and will continue to rise with each ne","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T18:24:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010499609","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956920-1843481262699772","game_id":"steam-4956920","kind":"announcement","title":"A New Look for Our Heroes!","summary":"Hey everyone, Today, we’re showing off two characters: our redrawn protagonist and the elf heroine we’re still working on. Her artwork isn’t 100% finished yet — there are still details to refine and finishing touches to add. We may update some of the other characters as well. For now, we’re sharing what we’re currently working on, and we’d love to hear your thoughts! How do you like the protagonist’s new look? What do you think of the elf? By the way, we’ve reworked the background too. Did you n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T16:03:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262699772","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956920-1842212951313139","game_id":"steam-4956920","kind":"announcement","title":"How’s The Blood Diary coming along?","summary":"We’re working on it, friends! Just not quite as quickly as we’d like. Great games require careful attention to every little detail. Wouldn’t you agree?Have you played the demo yet? What did you think? If you have any cool ideas for new content, share them with us - your suggestions might even inspire brand-new gameplay mechanics!The Blood Diary on Steam - demo available now:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T11:38:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951313139","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956920-1842212951302900","game_id":"steam-4956920","kind":"announcement","title":"Heroes Saga Q&A - What’s Next for the Game?","summary":"Friends! We’ve gathered some of the questions we receive most often about Heroes Saga and decided to answer them all in one post.When will the next major update be released? We’re planning to release it within the next few months. As development progresses, we’ll share more news and behind-the-scenes updates in separate posts. Can the current version of the game be considered a long prologue? No - we see it as the beginning of the main story. The current version includes the prologue and the fir","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T11:27:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951302900","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956920-1842212951297965","game_id":"steam-4956920","kind":"announcement","title":"Thicc Magic. Elves' Perverted Beauty Standards.gif - Demo Out Now!","summary":"Friends,We’ve just released the demo for Thicc Magic. Elves' Perverted Beauty Standards.gif!And yes - the demo turned out seriously hot!!! Check it out here:For those who may have forgotten, this is another upcoming project that will be published on our Steam account under the FEYADA banner.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T19:19:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297965","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956920-1840310314352211","game_id":"steam-4956920","kind":"announcement","title":"Soon!","summary":"Heart of the Bunker in Steam:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T17:41:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314352211","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956920-1839676055889305","game_id":"steam-4956920","kind":"announcement","title":"Current Progress on Heroes Saga!","summary":"Friends!The team is currently working on version 0.3 of Heroes Saga. Alongside creating new content, we continue to improve existing mechanics, fix bugs, take your feedback into account, and make the overall gameplay experience smoother and more enjoyable.Thank you for supporting Heroes Saga and helping us make the game even better!Heroes Saga on Steam:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T20:37:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055889305","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956920-1839676055883489","game_id":"steam-4956920","kind":"announcement","title":"A Dance of Blades: The New Combat System Will Make Your Heart Race","summary":"Friends! We’re continuing to expand the combat system in The Blood Diary. In future versions, enemies will be able to unleash full attack combos, so simply attacking won’t be enough - you’ll need to watch their movements carefully and react at exactly the right moment. Dodge incoming attacks, parry strikes at the last second, and wait for the perfect opportunity to counterattack. If you manage to avoid the enemy’s entire combo, Selena will take no damage and will be able to respond with her sign","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T20:21:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055883489","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956920-1839041357033629","game_id":"steam-4956920","kind":"announcement","title":"Strip Away Their Armor in Thicc Magic!","summary":"In Thicc Magic: Elves' Perverted Beauty Standards.gif, sustained attacks allow you to break 